--TEST--
the class inside a typed local's `array<…>` is the innermost written type under the cursor, so it opens the class's declaration where a scalar in the same position still answers `none`, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class View
{
    public string $name = "";
}

array<Vi<|>ew> $views = [new View()];
echo $views[0]->name;
--REQUEST--
definition
